      "segment_id": "S00001",
      "start_char": 0,
      "end_char": 187,
      "text": "MEXICO\n5. Strengthened customs cooperation could go a long way in facilitating Mexico’s trade\nwith this region. Mexico could replicate in the Southern border the cooperation programs and\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "S00002",
      "start_char": 187,
      "end_char": 374,
      "text": "mechanisms in place with the U.S. following the 1994 North American Free Trade Agreement (IMF\n2022). This would help to improve coordination, infrastructure in the border areas, capacity\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "S00003",
      "start_char": 374,
      "end_char": 464,
      "text": "development and risk management, and to reduce bottlenecks.\nINTERNATIONAL MONETARY FUND 91"
    }
  ]
}

